---
const topics = [
  'Identity & Trust',
  'Distributed Systems',
  'The Data Layer',
  'Networking',
  'Observability',
  'ML Concepts',
  'AI Systems Engineering',
  'Architecture',
  'Concurrency',
  'Reliability',
  'Delivery',
  'Compliance',
  'Application Security',
  'Testing',
];
---
<section id="writing" class="section" aria-labelledby="writing-label">
  <h2 class="section-heading" id="writing-label">Writing</h2>
  <div class="writing-block">
    <p>I'm working on a series of interactive articles on the working knowledge I actually use. I've written a few so far. Once they're in shape, I'll polish them with AI and publish them here. Expected topics: identity and trust, distributed systems, the data layer, networking, observability, ML concepts, AI systems engineering, architecture, concurrency, reliability, delivery, compliance, application security, testing.</p>
    <div class="tag-row">
      {topics.map((topic) => <span class="tag">{topic}</span>)}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
